WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:06.585
&gt;&gt; Laura: I LEARNED ABOUT THIS

00:00:06.586 --> 00:00:10.956
OVER THE WEEKEND, AND I WAS JUST

00:00:10.957 --> 00:00:11.590
INFURIATED.

00:00:11.591 --> 00:00:12.791
AN 11-YEAR-OLD GIRL WAS TOLD SHE

00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:16.328
HAD TO WRITE A REPORT ON HER

00:00:16.329 --> 00:00:16.628
HERO.

00:00:16.629 --> 00:00:17.496
SHE QUICKLY CHOSE PRESIDENT

00:00:17.497 --> 00:00:19.598
TRUMP, PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED

00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:21.266
STATES, SOMEONE SHE HAS ADMIRED

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:22.301
SINCE THIRD GRADE.

00:00:22.302 --> 00:00:23.769
BUT HER TEACHER SAYS NO.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.270
SHAMED HER IN FRONT OF OTHER

00:00:25.271 --> 00:00:27.206
STUDENTS AND WARNED BELLA TO

00:00:27.207 --> 00:00:31.143
CHOOSE A DIFFERENT HERO.

00:00:31.144 --> 00:00:39.284
THE SCHOOL DISTRICT

00:00:39.285 --> 00:00:42.821
SUPERINTENDENT TELLING "THE

00:00:42.822 --> 00:00:43.089
INGRAHAM ANGLE" --

00:00:46.426 --> 00:00:52.231
BELLA'S PARENTS JOIN ME NOW

00:00:52.232 --> 00:00:53.733
VALUE

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.972
&gt;&gt; WHEN SHE FOUND OUT THAT TRUMP

00:00:59.973 --> 00:01:03.308
WAS HER HERO, SHE SAID, YOU'RE

00:01:03.309 --> 00:01:04.610
NOT ALLOWED TO PICK TRUMP.

00:01:04.611 --> 00:01:06.812
HE SPREADS NEGATIVITY AND HE

00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:10.115
SAYS BAD THINGS ABOUT WOMEN.

00:01:10.116 --> 00:01:12.451
AND I WAS LIKE # FLOORED WHEN I

00:01:12.452 --> 00:01:13.152
HEARD THAT.

00:01:13.153 --> 00:01:16.688
&gt;&gt; Laura: WELL, FOR A LITTLE

00:01:16.689 --> 00:01:21.593
GIRL TO HAVE THE POISE TO NOT

00:01:21.594 --> 00:01:24.663
JUST BUCKLE UNDER THE PRESSURE

00:01:24.664 --> 00:01:27.366
AND ACTUALLY COME HOME AND SAY,

00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:30.135
MOM, DAD, THIS DOESN'T SEEM

00:01:30.136 --> 00:01:31.203
RIGHT, THAT'S WHAT ACTUALLY

00:01:31.204 --> 00:01:33.405
GIVES ME A LOT OF HOPE, IS THAT

00:01:33.406 --> 00:01:37.776
YOUR LITTLE GIRL SAID, NO, I'M

00:01:37.777 --> 00:01:38.644
NOT GIVING IN.

00:01:38.645 --> 00:01:41.246
THAT'S PRETTY UNUSUAL, I HAVE TO

00:01:41.247 --> 00:01:42.181
SAY.

00:01:42.182 --> 00:01:45.651
&gt;&gt; WELL, I'M GOING TO SAY THIS

00:01:45.652 --> 00:01:46.552
TO YOU.

00:01:46.553 --> 00:01:49.688
MY DAUGHTER CALLED MY WIFE

00:01:49.689 --> 00:01:51.890
DURING THE SCHOOL DAY TO LET MY

00:01:51.891 --> 00:01:53.292
WIFE KNOW THAT.

00:01:53.293 --> 00:01:55.194
AND THE UPSETTING THING TO ME,

00:01:55.195 --> 00:01:57.629
WHICH I ACTUALLY FOUND OUT

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:00.666
LATER, WAS THAT NOT ONLY WAS MY

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.367
DAUGHTER TOLD THAT SHE COULDN'T

00:02:02.368 --> 00:02:04.736
DO THAT, BUT SHE HAD TO GO

00:02:04.737 --> 00:02:08.240
AROUND AND PICK SOMEBODY ELSE AS

00:02:08.241 --> 00:02:09.508
HER HERO.

00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:11.109
WHEN MY DAUGHTER SPOKE TO MY

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.812
WIFE -- YES, SOMEBODY ELSE'S

00:02:13.813 --> 00:02:14.112
HERO.

00:02:14.113 --> 00:02:18.750
&gt;&gt; YEAH, GO AROUND AND CHOOSE --

00:02:18.751 --> 00:02:20.152
&gt;&gt; Laura: AND DIDN'T SOMEBODY IN

00:02:20.153 --> 00:02:21.553
THE CLASS ALSO PICK OBAMA AND

00:02:21.554 --> 00:02:24.089
THAT WAS OKAY?

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:24.957
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:26.325
&gt;&gt; APPARENTLY, YEAH, MM-HM.

00:02:26.326 --> 00:02:30.028
&gt;&gt; Laura: NATURALLY, THAT'S A

00:02:30.029 --> 00:02:30.362
SHOCK.

00:02:30.363 --> 00:02:36.435
&gt;&gt; SO, MY OUTBURST AT THE BOARD

00:02:36.436 --> 00:02:39.872
OF ED MEETING HAD A LOT TO DO

00:02:39.873 --> 00:02:43.809
WITH THAT BECAUSE --

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.576
&gt;&gt; Laura: ARE YOU BOTH SATISFIED

00:02:44.577 --> 00:02:46.879
-- SORRY TO INTERRUPT, BUT ARE

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.647
YOU BOTH SATISFIED WITH THE

00:02:48.648 --> 00:02:50.282
SCHOOL'S RESPONSE HERE?

00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:52.150
I TWEETED OUT YOUR REACTION.

00:02:52.151 --> 00:02:53.752
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:02:53.753 --> 00:02:54.419
&gt;&gt; Laura: OKAY.

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.488
WHAT DO YOU WANT FROM THE

00:02:56.489 --> 00:02:56.822
SCHOOL?

00:02:56.823 --> 00:02:59.424
THEY SEEM A SOMEWHAT APOLOGETIC.

00:02:59.425 --> 00:03:00.392
&gt;&gt; I'M JUST GOING TO SAY.

00:03:00.393 --> 00:03:01.793
THE MESSAGE THAT YOU JUST

00:03:01.794 --> 00:03:03.996
PLAYED, MY WIFE AND I HAVE NEVER

00:03:03.997 --> 00:03:04.329
HEARD.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.030
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:03:05.031 --> 00:03:09.735
&gt;&gt; NOW, LISTEN, WE LOVE OUR

00:03:09.736 --> 00:03:10.235
COMMUNITY.

00:03:10.236 --> 00:03:15.173
AND WE HAVE A LOT OF SUPPORT

00:03:15.174 --> 00:03:16.275
WITHIN THERE.

00:03:16.276 --> 00:03:18.710
MY DAUGHTER IS ONE OF FOUR KIDS.

00:03:18.711 --> 00:03:21.847
WE HAVE THREE BOYS ALSO.

00:03:21.848 --> 00:03:25.384
THE SCHOOL -- WE'VE ALWAYS HAD

00:03:25.385 --> 00:03:26.952
VERY GOOD EXPERIENCES.

00:03:26.953 --> 00:03:32.257
AND THIS ONE IS A LITTLE SOUR.

00:03:32.258 --> 00:03:34.126
&gt;&gt; Laura: VALERIE, HOW IMPORTANT

00:03:34.127 --> 00:03:35.794
DO YOU THINK IT IS FOR PARENTS

00:03:35.795 --> 00:03:38.196
TO SPEAK OUT WHEN THIS KIND OF

00:03:38.197 --> 00:03:39.131
STUFF HAPPENS?

00:03:39.132 --> 00:03:41.700
BECAUSE IT HAPPENINGSE

00:03:41.701 --> 00:03:42.734
BECAUSE ITSHAPPENINGSE

00:03:42.735 --> 00:03:42.935
BECAUSE ITS APPENINGSE

00:03:42.936 --> 00:03:42.968
BECAUSE ITS  HPENINGSE

00:03:42.969 --> 00:03:43.001
BECAUSE ITS  HAPNINGSE

00:03:43.002 --> 00:03:43.035
BECAUSE ITS  HAPPENGSE

00:03:43.036 --> 00:03:43.068
BECAUSE ITS  HAPPENSSE

00:03:43.069 --> 00:03:45.103
BECAUSE ITS  HAPPENS ALL THE

00:03:45.104 --> 00:03:45.404
TIME.

00:03:45.405 --> 00:03:46.505
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S EXTREMELY

00:03:46.506 --> 00:03:46.972
IMPORTANT.

00:03:46.973 --> 00:03:48.440
AND I AM VERY GRATEFUL AND HAPPY

00:03:48.441 --> 00:03:50.475
THAT THIS STORY HAS GOTTEN AS

00:03:50.476 --> 00:03:52.244
BIG AS IT HAS BECAUSE THIS STORY

00:03:52.245 --> 00:03:55.180
NEEDS TO BE TOLD.

00:03:55.181 --> 00:03:56.815
AND I'M VERY PROUD THAT MY

00:03:56.816 --> 00:03:58.083
DAUGHTER KNEW THAT THAT WAS

00:03:58.084 --> 00:04:00.652
WRONG AND CALLED ME DURING THE

00:04:00.653 --> 00:04:02.788
SCHOOL TO TELL ME THIS BECAUSE,

00:04:02.789 --> 00:04:04.856
LET ME TELL YOU, LAURA --

00:04:04.857 --> 00:04:06.191
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU TAUGHT HER.

00:04:06.192 --> 00:04:06.692
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:04:06.693 --> 00:04:09.828
AND IF SHE DIDN'T TELL ME THIS,

00:04:09.829 --> 00:04:11.797
SHE WASN'T DOING TRUMP.

00:04:11.798 --> 00:04:13.198
SHE'S ABLE TO DO TRUMP BECAUSE

00:04:13.199 --> 00:04:14.333
OF ME AND MY HUSBAND, NOT

00:04:14.334 --> 00:04:17.102
BECAUSE OF THE SCHOOL, THE

00:04:17.103 --> 00:04:18.737
DISTRICT, OR THE DISTRICT.

00:04:18.738 --> 00:04:19.938
BECAUSE WE RAISED HOLY HELL

00:04:19.939 --> 00:04:20.706
ABOUT IT.

00:04:20.707 --> 00:04:22.708
AND THIS IS AN IN-SCHOOL

00:04:22.709 --> 00:04:23.141
PROJECT.

00:04:23.142 --> 00:04:24.076
&gt;&gt; Laura: WE'RE GOING TO TRY TO

00:04:24.077 --> 00:04:25.877
GET THE TEACHER ON THE SHOW AND

00:04:25.878 --> 00:04:28.647
SEE WHAT SHE SAYS NOW THAT SHE

00:04:28.648 --> 00:04:30.816
MAYBE HAS HAD TIME TO REFLECT ON

00:04:30.817 --> 00:04:33.720
IT AND WE'LL CHECK BACK WITH YOU

